{
  "name": "cep_mesh_e2e",
  "description": "CEP coherence 流量**穿过真实 RouterTLM XY mesh**(2×2)抵达对端 —— change `cpptlm-cep-mesh-e2e-carrier` 的联合拓扑。⚠️ **层次化(change `cpptlm-cep-mesh-interconnect-submodule`)**:互联件(4 router + 8 条环边)已抽到独立蓝图 `configs/interconnect/cep_mesh_2x2.json`,由 `fabric`(`CepMeshInterconnect`)承载 ⇒ **互联层与业务层在文件与命名空间两个维度分离**。本文件只保留业务模块(tg / w / home / nic_a / nic_b)+ `fabric` + **跨层** connection。路径:业务流量 → 端口面 wrapper → CohIf 网络接口(nic_a) → fabric 的 node 0 接入点 → 2×2 mesh → fabric 的 node 3 接入点 → nic_b → home → Completion 原路返回。⚠️ **暴露端口模型 = router LOCAL 口的 4 个通道全暴露**(req_in / req_out / resp_in / resp_out):平铺基线(HEAD)用 2 条对称 connection,经 Step 7b 的**自动镜像**为每个 LOCAL 通道建 4 条 PortPair;Step 7c 是**单向**语义(per ADR-X.15 决策 2)⇒ 必须显式暴露 4 个通道 + 声明 4 条 connection 才能与平铺基线**逐条 pair 等价**。⚠️ 通道配对规则(按内部端口后缀):`req_in[N]`↔对端`req_out`、`resp_in[N]`↔对端`resp_out`、`req_out[N]`↔对端`req_in`、`resp_out[N]`↔对端`resp_in`。⚠️ `nic_a`/`nic_b` **各自**都配 `address_regions`(0x1000-0x2000 指向对方节点)⇒ 回程的 lookup_node 也能命中。",
  "modules": [
    {
      "name": "tg",
      "type": "TrafficGenTLM",
      "params": {
        "seed": 20261116
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "w",
      "type": "StubCacheEndpointTLM"
    },
    {
      "name": "home",
      "type": "CohIfResponderTLM",
      "params": {
        "emit_completions": true
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "nic_a",
      "type": "CohIfNICTLM",
      "params": {
        "node_id": 0,
        "mesh_x": 2,
        "mesh_y": 2,
        "address_regions": [
          {
            "base": "0x1000",
            "size": "0x1000",
            "target_node": 3
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "nic_b",
      "type": "CohIfNICTLM",
      "params": {
        "node_id": 3,
        "mesh_x": 2,
        "mesh_y": 2,
        "address_regions": [
          {
            "base": "0x1000",
            "size": "0x1000",
            "target_node": 0
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "fabric",
      "type": "CepMeshInterconnect",
      "params": {
        "template": "configs/interconnect/cep_mesh_2x2.json"
      },
      "outputs": [
        { "internal": "r00.req_out[4]", "external": "node0_req_out" },
        { "internal": "r00.resp_out[4]", "external": "node0_resp_out" },
        { "internal": "r11.req_out[4]", "external": "node3_req_out" },
        { "internal": "r11.resp_out[4]", "external": "node3_resp_out" }
      ],
      "inputs": [
        { "internal": "r00.req_in[4]", "external": "node0_req_in" },
        { "internal": "r00.resp_in[4]", "external": "node0_resp_in" },
        { "internal": "r11.req_in[4]", "external": "node3_req_in" },
        { "internal": "r11.resp_in[4]", "external": "node3_resp_in" }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": [
    { "src": "tg", "dst": "w.0", "latency": 0, "bandwidth": 100 },
    { "src": "w.1", "dst": "nic_a.0", "latency": 0, "bandwidth": 100 },
    { "src": "nic_a.0", "dst": "w.1", "latency": 0, "bandwidth": 100 },
    { "src": "nic_b.0", "dst": "home.0", "latency": 0, "bandwidth": 100 },
    { "src": "home.0", "dst": "nic_b.0", "latency": 0, "bandwidth": 100 },

    { "src": "nic_a.1", "dst": "fabric.node0_req_in", "latency": 1, "bandwidth": 100 },
    { "src": "fabric.node0_resp_out", "dst": "nic_a.1", "latency": 1, "bandwidth": 100 },
    { "src": "fabric.node0_req_out", "dst": "nic_a.1", "latency": 1, "bandwidth": 100 },
    { "src": "nic_a.1", "dst": "fabric.node0_resp_in", "latency": 1, "bandwidth": 100 },

    { "src": "nic_b.1", "dst": "fabric.node3_req_in", "latency": 1, "bandwidth": 100 },
    { "src": "fabric.node3_resp_out", "dst": "nic_b.1", "latency": 1, "bandwidth": 100 },
    { "src": "fabric.node3_req_out", "dst": "nic_b.1", "latency": 1, "bandwidth": 100 },
    { "src": "nic_b.1", "dst": "fabric.node3_resp_in", "latency": 1, "bandwidth": 100 }
  ],
  "cep": {
    "protocol_instances": "include/tlm/cep/protocol_instances.json"
  }
}
